      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file that flags or redacts unsafe spans from text using an external provider, I need to select a concrete external service that provides text analysis or redaction capabilities. I will use the Amazon Comprehend service, which is a natural language processing (NLP) service that uses machine learning to find insights and relationships in text. I will import the necessary SDK and use the specific client class to identify the provider in the code. </thinking>\n",
